839","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0839.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0268.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0049","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1175","title":"Fetchmail 6.0.0 及之前版本 DNS getmxrecord 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Fetchmail 6.0.0及之前版本的 getmxrecord 函数存在边界检查缺失漏洞。远程攻击者可利用恶意的 DNS 服务器返回特制的 DNS 数据包，当 Fetchmail 处理该数据包时，函数未正确校验数据边界，导致读取超出预期范围的内存区域，从而触发程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，影响 Fetchmail 6.0.0及之前版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1175"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:52Z","remediation":"升级 Fetchmail 至 6.1.0 或更高版本。各发行版参照相应安全公告安装更新：Debian 安装 DSA-171 更新包，Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2002:215 更新包，Mandrake 安装 MDKSA-2002:063 更新。若无法立即升级，避免在 multidrop 多投递模式下运行 Fetchmail，并确保 DNS 服务器位于可信网络内以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000531","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103340148625187&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-215.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-171","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10203.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-063.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2402.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5826","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2002/CVE-2002-1175.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b3697bfa0e74d327e178cbbc4c3c4d390b71eef/2002/CVE-2002-1175.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1175.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1175.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1175.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1175","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1175.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1175.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1175.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0aa53285166fed6b300b29cf483b59e9c54d85d6/2002/CVE-2002-1175.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0048","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1174","title":"Fetchmail 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Fetchmail 6.0.0 及之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向邮件服务器发送特制的超长邮件头（readheaders 函数处理不当）或超长 Received: 头（parse_received 函数解析不当）触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标服务崩溃（拒绝服务）或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Fetchmail 全线旧版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1174"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:52Z","remediation":"立即将 Fetchmail 升级至 6.1.0 及以上版本。Debian Woody 用户应升级至 5.9.11-6.1，Potato 用户升级至 5.3.3-4.2；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002:215 提供的更新包；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2002:063 更新。如无法升级，避免在 multidrop 模式下运行 fetchmail，并在邮件服务器上限制入站邮件头长度以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000531","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103340148625187&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-215.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-171","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10203.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-063.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2402.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5825","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5827","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2002/CVE-2002-1174.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b3697bfa0e74d327e178cbbc4c3c4d390b71eef/2002/CVE-2002-1174.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1174.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1174.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1174.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1174","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1174.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1174.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1174.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0aa53285166fed6b300b29cf483b59e9c54d85d6/2002/CVE-2002-1174.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0047","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1170","title":"Net-SNMP SNMP 守护进程空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.\n\nLet me analyze the requirements:\n1. Chinese description, ≥50 characters\n2. Must cover: vulnerability principle (null pointer dereference), impact range (Net-SNMP 5.0.1-5.0.5), attack conditions (remote, no auth needed, but requires knowledge of SNMP community string)\n3. Translate NVD English description to fluent Chinese, supplement with local data technical details\n4. Don't fabricate URLs\n\nFrom the NVD data:\n- The handle_var_requests function in snmp_agent.c for the SNMP daemon in the Net-SNMP (formerly ucd-snmp) package 5.0.1 through 5.0.5 allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (crash) via a NULL dereference.\n\nFrom the local data and PoC references, I can see:\n- The vulnerability is in handle_var_requests() at line 1876 of agent/snmp_agent.c\n- Exploitation requires foreknowledge of a known SNMP community string (read or read/write)\n- Affects installations where \"public\" read-only community string hasn't been changed\n- The issue is a NULL dereference - asp->treecache_num is NULL but the code tries to access it with <= comparison\n\nLet me compose a proper description that covers all required aspects and is ≥50 characters.\n\nThe description should be placed inside <value> tags only.<value>Net-SNMP SNMP 守护进程的 agent/snmp_agent.c 中 handle_var_requests 函数存在空指针解引用漏洞。攻击者需预先知晓目标系统的 SNMP 共同体字符串（如默认的 \"public\" 只读社区名），随后发送精心构造的 SNMP 数据包即可触发该漏洞，导致 SNMP 服务崩溃并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Net-SNMP 5.0.1 至 5.0.5 所有版本，CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1170"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:52Z","remediation":"升级 Net-SNMP 至 5.0.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了 snmp_agent.c 中 handle_var_requests 函数的 NULL 指针解引用问题。升级后重启 SNMP 服务（service snmpd restart），并确认服务正常运行。若无法立即升级，可在网络边界防火墙层面限制对 SNMP 端口（UDP 161/162）的外部访问，仅允许受信任的管理站 IP 访问，临时降低被远程利用导致拒绝服务的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103359362020365&w=2","http://sourceforge.net/forum/forum.php?forum_id=216532","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/10.02.02.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-228.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5862","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10250","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2002/CVE-2002-1170.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c61100b82badca16ad107892eaf1ce53a00c3776/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1170.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1170.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1170","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7ebe16a87d7482b578f5baf29517e74408f62ab5/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1170.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1170.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1170.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1170.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1170.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e360b144e9e9de9c01917f4eb9026f28ed6b0719/2002/CVE-2002-1170.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0046","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1165","title":"Sendmail SMRSH 双管道访问验证绕过漏洞","description":"Sendmail 的 SMRSH（Sendmail Restricted Shell）存在命令注入漏洞，由于对 `||` 双管道序列和 `/` 字符过滤不严，攻击者可在已受限的 smrsh 环境中插入额外命令绕过访问限制，导致权限提升或敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Sendmail 8.12.6、8.11.6-15 及 1998 年 5 月 19 日后发布的 8.11 以上版本，需要本地访问权限，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1165"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:51Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.12.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 smrsh 对 || 双管道和 / 字符的过滤不严问题。如无法升级，可限制本地用户对 smrsh 的访问权限，仅允许受信任用户使用，并移除 smrsh 可执行目录中不必要的命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000532","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103350914307274&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/7826","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10232.php","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:083","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-073.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5845","http://www.sendmail.org/smrsh.adv.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21884","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1165.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1165","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2002-1165","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1165.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2002-1165","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2002-1165","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1165.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/24bf8ab9ac19d70e8e7ca347101f59bbc2694f11/2002/CVE-2002-1165.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1165.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1165.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0043","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1156","title":"Apache HTTP Server 2.0.42 CGI 源代码信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache 2.0.42 存在信息泄漏漏洞，当服务器目录同时启用 WebDAV 和 CGI 功能时，远程攻击者可通过向该目录发送特制的 POST 请求，绕过访问控制限制，直接获取 CGI 脚本的源代码而非执行结果。该漏洞导致敏感业务逻辑、数据库凭证等源码信息泄露，攻击面取决于服务器上 CGI 脚本的部署情况，无需身份认证即可远程利用。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1156"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:49Z","remediation":"立即将 Apache HTTP Server 升级至 2.0.43 或更高版本（该漏洞仅影响 2.0.42）。由于 Apache 2.0 系列已于 2013 年停止维护，建议升级至当前受支持的 2.4.x 版本。如无法升级，可在配置中禁用 WebDAV 模块（注释或移除 `mod_dav` 加载指令），或确保启用 CGI 的目录不启用 WebDAV。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4617","http://www.apache.org/dist/httpd/CHANGES_2.0","http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/02-10-04","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/910713","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6065","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10499","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/54a42d4b01968df1117cea77fc53d6beb931c0e05936ad02af93e9ac%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5df9bfb86a3b054bb985a45ff9250b0332c9ecc181eec232489e7f79%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r0276683d8e1e07153fc8642618830ac0ade85b9ae0dc7b07f63bb8fc%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r2cb985de917e7da0848c440535f65a247754db8b2154a10089e4247b%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5001ecf3d6b2bdd0b732e527654248abb264f08390045d30709a92f6%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5f9c22f9c28adbd9f00556059edc7b03a5d5bb71d4bb80257c0d34e4%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r8828e649175df56f1f9e3919938ac7826128525426e2748f0ab62feb%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9e8622254184645bc963a1d47c5d47f6d5a36d6f080d8d2c43b2b142%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rd00b45b93fda4a5bd013b28587207d0e00f99f6e3308dbb6025f3b01%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b743770