息，导致 Web 服务器的错误日志迅速膨胀并填满磁盘空间，从而引发拒绝服务（DoS）攻击。该漏洞主要影响部署了受影响版本 Analog 的 Web 服务器，攻击条件简单，利用方式为发送特定指令触发日志溢出。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1154"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:49Z","remediation":"建议将 Analog 升级到 5.23 或更高版本，以修复 anlgform.pl 对 PROGRESSFREQ 命令缺乏访问限制的问题。如无法立即升级，可通过配置 Web 服务器的日志轮转（Log Rotation）策略或限制请求频率来缓解磁盘空间被错误日志迅速填满的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.analog.cx/security5.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10344.php","http://www.osvdb.org/3779","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-059.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1154.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1154.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1154","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1154.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1154.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1e9aa0e87d4eb1e9f99e0f5b9c02665ba8ee98ef/2002/CVE-2002-1154.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1154.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-11xx/CVE-2002-1154.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/f4ac1c4571cf4619eb3fd2e729b251b1c03b9450/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1154.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1154.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0042.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0042.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0041","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1146","title":"GNU glibc 及 BIND DNS 解析库缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BIND 4、BIND 8.2.x 的 stub resolver 库以及 glibc 2.2.5 及更早版本、libc 和 libresolv 等基础库中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞的原理是在处理 DNS 响应时，解析库错误地使用了最大缓冲区大小而非实际数据的长度，导致在读取 DNS 响应时发生越界读取（Read Buffer Overflow）。远程攻击者可以通过向目标系统发送特制的 DNS 响应数据包来触发此漏洞，导致受影响的服务或系统崩溃，从而引发拒绝服务（DoS）攻击。该漏洞影响范围涵盖大量依赖上述库的早期 UNIX 系统，攻击条件为目标系统向 DNS 服务器发起请求并接收到攻击者伪造的恶意响应数据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1146"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:48Z","remediation":"建议将 glibc 升级至 2.2.6 或更高版本，并将 BIND 升级至 8.3 及以上版本或应用 BIND 8.2.x 的相关安全补丁，以修复 DNS 响应处理时的缓冲区溢出问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000535","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10295.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/738331","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2004:009","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-197.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-258.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-022.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-212.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1146.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1146","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1146.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1146.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7330b0580e3b5cfcde14ca2a28aa1774cbe1d7d1/2002/CVE-2002-1146.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1146.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1146.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-11xx/CVE-2002-1146.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/f4ac1c4571cf4619eb3fd2e729b251b1c03b9450/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1146.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1146.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0027","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0840","title":"Apache HTTP Server 错误页面跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.26 及之前版本、2.0.42 及之前版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。当服务器配置 UseCanonicalName 为 \"Off\" 且支持通配符 DNS 解析时，远程攻击者可通过在 HTTP 请求的 Host 头中注入恶意脚本代码，该脚本会在默认错误页面中被反射执行，导致受害者在浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本，窃取 Cookie 或伪造页面内容。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户访问特制链接即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0840"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:14Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.0.43 及以上版本，或 1.3.27 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，将 UseCanonicalName 指令设为 \"On\" 以禁用通配符 DNS 支持，并在反向代理或 WAF 层过滤 Host 头中的恶意脚本内容作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0254.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0003.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000530","http://marc.info/?l=apache-httpd-announce&m=103367938230488&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103357160425708&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103376585508776&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4617","http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/02-10-04","