-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0394","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0394.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0709","title":"SurfControl SuperScout WebFilter SQL注入漏洞","description":"SurfControl SuperScout WebFilter for Windows 2000 的 Web Reports Server 组件中的 SimpleBar.dll 存在 SQL 注入漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 RunReport 选项传递特制的 SQL 查询参数，利用该漏洞执行任意 SQL 语句，导致数据库中的敏感信息泄露、数据篡改或进一步获取系统控制权。该漏洞影响 SurfControl SuperScout WebFilter 系列产品，攻击复杂度低，已有公开利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0709"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:59Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 SurfControl SuperScout WebFilter 3.0 的 Web Reports Server 组件（SimpleBar.dll），厂商已停止维护该产品且不再发布安全补丁。建议立即采取以下措施：1）在防火墙层面限制对 Web Reports Server 默认端口 TCP 8888 的访问，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 地址；2）如业务仍需要 Web 过滤功能，应迁移至仍在安全更新支持期内的替代方案（如 Forcepoint Web Security 或同类产品）；3）检查并删除服务器上不再使用的 SimpleBar.dll 及相关报表 DLL 文件，以彻底消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103359690824103&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10245.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5859","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21898","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0709.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0709.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0709","https://github.com/sullo/nikto/blob/b4c6d4769b2f629b2ecb731ccf9a8a972b7ee65c/program/databases/db_server_msgs","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0709.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0709.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3e2d7833ca42f41a6bb2e84d7adeb5471252536d/2002/CVE-2002-0709.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0709.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0709.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0709.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0394.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0392","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0392.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0708","title":"SurfControl SuperScout WebFilter 目录遍历漏洞","description":"SurfControl SuperScout WebFilter for Windows 2000 的 Web Reports Server 组件存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送包含三个点号（...）序列的特制 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 SurfControl SuperScout WebFilter for Windows 2000 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前已有公开的利用代码，攻击者可通过 Exploit-DB 获取 PoC 进行验证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0708"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:59Z","remediation":"该产品已停止技术支持，官方未发布补丁。建议立即禁用 Web Reports Server 服务（默认端口 8888），或通过防火墙限制仅允许受信管理 IP 访问该端口。如仍需查看报表，改用终端会话（如 RDP）直连服务器操作，避免将报表服务暴露于网络。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103359690824103&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10244.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5857","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21897","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0708.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0708.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0708","https://github.com/sullo/nikto/blob/b4c6d4769b2f629b2ecb731ccf9a8a972b7ee65c/program/databases/db_server_msgs","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0708.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0708.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3e2d7833ca42f41a6bb2e84d7adeb5471252536d/2002/CVE-2002-0708.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0708.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-07xx/CVE-2002-0708.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0708.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0392.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0392.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0392.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0387","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0387.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0693","title":"Microsoft Windows HTML Help ActiveX 控件缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 的 HTML Help ActiveX 控件（hhctrl.ocx）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制网页，利用 Alink 函数的长参数或 showHelp 函数的长参数脚本触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而在用户浏览网页时以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 98/98 SE/Me/NT 4.0/2000/XP 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者需诱导用户使用 Internet Explorer 访问恶意网页即可触发，无需额外认证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0693"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:57Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Windows 98/ME/NT 4.0/2000/XP 系统，微软已不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级到受支持的 Windows 10/11 版本。如无法升级，可通过注册表设置 hhctrl.ocx 的 kill bit（CLSID: 52a2aaae-085d-4187-97ea-8c30db990436）来禁用该 ActiveX 控件，在注册表 `HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Internet Explorer\\ActiveX Compatibility` 下新建该 CLSID 项，将 Compatibility Flags DWORD 值设为 0x400。同时建议将 Internet 区域安全级别设为高，禁用 ActiveX 脚